[Play "Cover and Retreat - six-player example"]
[Badge "adapted training example"]
[Desc "Two throwers attack while two loaded teammates cover the retreat. Six-player foam illustration adapted from British Dodgeball's five-ball cover coaching, not a reconstruction of a team possession. The four live players must fill four distinct loaded roles. Recheck the clock and opponent pressure before advancing."]
